22
00:02:07.062 --> 00:02:11.524
and finally answers position + 1 if that bay exists, else -1.

23
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.406
The Fenwick tree stores in cell i the sum of the last i &amp; -i bays, so every

24
00:02:17.406 --> 00:02:22.747
